I stop at the cheese stall.
The vendor offers me a slice of strong winter cheese.
"Would you like to taste?" he asks.
"Yes please," I answer and taste the cheese.
I really like the sharp flavour.
"I would like to buy a piece," I say.
"How much is it?"
"Eighty-five kroner," he answers.
I pay by card.
I tap my phone on the terminal.
I put the cheese in my bag.
